function flattenKpiTree(rows){const out=[],seen=new Set();const walk=p=>{if(!p)return;const key=[p.role,p.nik||p.nama,p.area||p.region].join('|');if(!seen.has(key)){seen.add(key);out.push(p);} (p.children||[]).forEach(walk);};(rows||[]).forEach(walk);return out;}
function kpiIndicatorKey(i){return [i.metric||'',i.brand||'',i.label||'',...(i.types||[])].join('|');}
function kpiIndicatorLabel(i){return esc(i.label||[i.metric,i.brand].filter(Boolean).join(' ')||'Indikator')+(i.weight!=null?'<small class="cellsub">Bobot '+pct(i.weight)+'</small>':'');}
function weightedKpiIndicatorScore(i){return i?.score==null?null:Number(i.score)*Number(i.weight||0)/100;}
const V7KC={IPHONE:['#5B3FD6','#EFEBFC'],ITEL:['#0E6E64','#E2F4F1'],MOTOPAD:['#B33D0B','#FCEEE4'],MOTOROLA:['#1E5FB8','#E3EEFB'],REALME:['#2E7D32','#E5F4E6'],TECNO:['#B4204F','#FCE7EE'],VILLAON:['#455A64','#E9EEF1'],INFINIX:['#7A5B00','#FFF4D6'],SAMSUNG:['#1B3F8F','#E4EAF7'],OPPO:['#1C7A4A','#E3F4EB'],VIVO:['#2149A8','#E5EBF9'],XIAOMI:['#C2410C','#FDEDE3']};
const v7kInd=i=>{const m=String(i.metric||i.label||'').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z]/g,'');return /^(ST|SELLTHRU|QTY)/.test(m)?'st':/^(SO|SELLOUT)/.test(m)?'so':/^(DA|DEALERAKTIF)/.test(m)?'da':/^IDDLE/.test(m)?'da':/^NOO/.test(m)?'noo':/^OM[ZS]ET/.test(m)?'om':'st';};
const v7kCol=b=>V7KC[String(b||'').toUpperCase()]||['#0B4C8F','#E6F0FB'],v7kPt=x=>x==null?'—':new Intl.NumberFormat('id-ID',{minimumFractionDigits:1,maximumFractionDigits:1}).format(x),v7kChip=x=>x==null||!Number.isFinite(Number(x))?'<span class="v7rgChip">—</span>':`<span class="v7rgChip ${x>=100?'gr':x>=80?'y':'r'}">${pct(x)}</span>`,v7kWho=p=>`<b>${esc(p.nama)}</b><small>${esc(p.area||p.region||'—')}</small>`,v7kRole=people=>({ASM:'ASM',SALES:'Sales',RGM:'RGM'}[people[0]?.role]||'Nama')+' · Area';
function kpiCompareTable(people,groupName){
 const indicators=[],seen=new Set();people.forEach(p=>{const g=p.kpi?.groups?.find(x=>x.name===groupName);(g?.indicators||[]).forEach(i=>{const key=kpiIndicatorKey(i);if(!seen.has(key)){seen.add(key);indicators.push(i);}});});
 if(!indicators.length)return '<div class="kpiCompareEmpty">Belum ada indikator untuk kelompok ini.</div>';
 const ta=(t,a)=>`<span class="v7kTa">${num(t)} / <b>${a==null?'—':num(a)}</b></span>`;
 const dataRows=people.map(p=>{const g=p.kpi?.groups?.find(x=>x.name===groupName),map=new Map((g?.indicators||[]).map(i=>[kpiIndicatorKey(i),i]));return `<tr><td class="l v7kWho">${v7kWho(p)}</td>${indicators.map(base=>{const i=map.get(kpiIndicatorKey(base)),score=i?weightedKpiIndicatorScore(i):null;const k='k-'+v7kInd(base);return i?`<td class="gs ${k}">${ta(i.target,i.actual)}</td><td class="${k}">${i.ach==null?'—':v7kChip(i.ach)}</td><td class="pt ${k}">${v7kPt(score)}</td>`:`<td class="gs ${k}">-</td><td class="${k}">-</td><td class="${k}">-</td>`;}).join('')}<td class="res">${g?v7kChip(g.score):'—'}</td></tr>`;});
 const avg=values=>{const a=values.filter(x=>Number.isFinite(Number(x))).map(Number);return a.length?a.reduce((n,x)=>n+x,0)/a.length:null;};
 const aggregateWeighted=[];let historyPending=false;
 const totalCells=indicators.map(base=>{
  const items=people.map(p=>p.kpi?.groups?.find(x=>x.name===groupName)?.indicators?.find(i=>kpiIndicatorKey(i)===kpiIndicatorKey(base))).filter(Boolean),
        target=items.reduce((n,i)=>n+Number(i.target||0),0),
        actual=items.some(i=>i.actual==null&&Number(i.target)>0)?null:base.metric==='IDDLE'&&items.every(i=>Array.isArray(i.iddlePairs))?new Set(items.flatMap(i=>i.iddlePairs)).size:items.reduce((n,i)=>n+Number(i.actual||0),0),
        achv=target>0&&actual!=null?actual/target*100:null;
  if(actual==null)historyPending=true;
  let rawScore=null;
  if(achv!=null){
   // Skor TOTAL dihitung ulang dari TOTAL Target/Aktual, bukan rata-rata skor orang (cap dideteksi dari data backend).
   const caps=items.filter(i=>Number.isFinite(Number(i.ach))&&Number.isFinite(Number(i.score))&&Number(i.ach)>Number(i.score)+0.05).map(i=>Number(i.score));
   const cap=caps.length?Math.max(...caps):null;
   rawScore=cap==null?achv:Math.min(achv,cap);
  }else{
   rawScore=avg(items.map(i=>i.score));
  }
  const weighted=rawScore==null?null:rawScore*Number(base.weight||0)/100;
  aggregateWeighted.push(weighted);
  const k='k-'+v7kInd(base);return `<td class="gs ${k}">${num(target)} / ${num(actual)}</td><td class="${k}">${achv==null?'—':v7kChip(achv)}</td><td class="pt ${k}">${v7kPt(weighted)}</td>`;
 }).join('');
 const groupTotal=aggregateWeighted.some(x=>x!=null)?aggregateWeighted.reduce((n,x)=>n+(Number(x)||0),0):null;
 const head1=indicators.map(i=>{const c=[0,0];const w=i.weight!=null?`<small>bobot ${String(decimal(i.weight)).replace(/,0$/,'')}%</small>`:'';return `<th class="grp k-${v7kInd(i)}" colspan="3">${esc(i.label||[i.metric,i.brand].filter(Boolean).join(' ')||'Indikator')}${w}</th>`;}).join('');
 const head2=indicators.map(i=>{const k='k-'+v7kInd(i);return `<th class="gs ${k}">Target / Aktual</th><th class="${k}">% Achv</th><th class="${k}">Poin</th>`;}).join('');
 return `<div class="table-scroll"><table class="v7kc" data-v7br="1" data-v7mc="1" data-v7uni="1"><thead><tr><th class="l" rowspan="2">${v7kRole(people)}</th>${head1}<th class="res" rowspan="2">Skor KPI</th></tr><tr>${head2}</tr></thead><tbody>${dataRows.join('')}<tr class="totalRow v7kT"><td class="l v7kWho"><b>TOTAL TIM</b><small>${num(people.length)} orang</small></td>${totalCells}<td class="res">${v7kChip(groupTotal)}</td></tr></tbody></table></div>`;
}
function kpiFinalSummaryTable(people,groupNames){
 const scoreOf=(p,name)=>p.kpi?.groups?.find(g=>g.name===name)?.score;
 const avg=values=>{const a=values.filter(x=>x!=null&&x!==''&&Number.isFinite(Number(x))).map(Number);return a.length?a.reduce((n,x)=>n+x,0)/a.length:null;};
 const gk=n=>{const u=String(n).toUpperCase();const b=Object.keys(V7KC).find(k=>u.includes(k));return b?V7KC[b]:['#1E5FB8','#E3EEFB'];},gs=n=>{const c=gk(n);return ` style="--d:${c[0]};--l:${c[1]}"`;};
 const sorted=[...people].sort((a,b)=>(b.kpi?.score??-1)-(a.kpi?.score??-1));
 const rows=sorted.map(p=>`<tr><td class="l v7kWho">${v7kWho(p)}</td>${groupNames.map((name,k)=>{const s=scoreOf(p,name);return `<td class="kg${k?'':' gs'}"${gs(name)}>${s==null?'—':pct(s)}</td>`;}).join('')}<td class="res">${v7kChip(p.kpi?.score)}</td></tr>`).join('');
 const avgRow=`<tr class="totalRow v7kT"><td class="l"><b>RATA-RATA TIM</b></td>${groupNames.map((name,k)=>{const s=avg(people.map(p=>scoreOf(p,name)));return `<td class="kg${k?'':' gs'}"${gs(name)}>${s==null?'—':pct(s)}</td>`;}).join('')}<td class="res">${v7kChip(avg(people.map(p=>p.kpi?.score)))}</td></tr>`;
 return `<div class="table-scroll"><table class="v7kc v7kSum" data-v7br="1" data-v7mc="1" data-v7uni="1"><thead><tr><th class="l">${v7kRole(people)}</th>${groupNames.map((n,k)=>`<th class="kg${k?'':' gs'}"${gs(n)}>${esc(n)}</th>`).join('')}<th class="res">Skor akhir</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows}${avgRow}</tbody></table></div>`;
}
function desktopKpiComparison(rows){
 const all=flattenKpiTree(rows).filter(p=>p.kpi&&!p.noData&&!(p.acting&&!v6KpiHasValue(p.kpi))),roleOrder=['ASM','SALES'],labels={RGM:'RGM',ASM:'ASM',SALES:'Sales'};let html='';
 roleOrder.forEach(role=>{const people=all.filter(p=>p.role===role);if(!people.length)return;const groupNames=[];people.forEach(p=>(p.kpi.groups||[]).forEach(g=>{if(!groupNames.includes(g.name))groupNames.push(g.name);}));const detailTables=groupNames.map(name=>`<section class="kpiCompareGroup"><h4>${esc(name)}</h4>${kpiCompareTable(people,name)}</section>`).join(''),average=v6KpiRegionScore(all),avgInd=(()=>{const sc=people.map(p=>p.kpi.score).filter(x=>x!=null);return sc.length?sc.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x),0)/sc.length:null;})();html+=`<details class="kpiCompareLevel" data-fold="kpiCompare${role}" ${collapsePrefs['kpiCompare'+role]===true?'open':''}><summary><span>Perbandingan KPI ${labels[role]}</span><small>${num(people.length)} orang · klik untuk buka/tutup</small><b class="kpiCompareScore" title="KPI total region (sama untuk RGM, ASM, Sales). Rata-rata skor per orang di level ini: ${avgInd==null?'—':pct(avgInd)}">${average==null?'—':pct(average)}</b></summary><p>${num(people.length)} orang · nama dan region tetap terlihat saat tabel digeser</p><div>${detailTables}<section class="kpiCompareGroup kpiSummaryGroup"><h4>RINGKASAN SKOR KPI</h4>${kpiFinalSummaryTable(people,groupNames)}</section></div></details>`;});
 return `<div class="kpiDesktopCompare">${html||'<div class="empty">Belum ada anggota tim yang dapat dibandingkan.</div>'}</div>`;
}
function mobileKpiComparison(rows){
 const all=flattenKpiTree(rows).filter(p=>p.kpi&&!p.noData&&!(p.acting&&!v6KpiHasValue(p.kpi))),roleOrder=['ASM','SALES'],labels={RGM:'RGM',ASM:'ASM',SALES:'Sales'};
 const html=roleOrder.map(role=>{const people=all.filter(p=>p.role===role);if(!people.length)return '';const average=people.reduce((n,p)=>n+Number(p.kpi.score||0),0)/people.length,cards=people.map(p=>{const level=p.role==='RGM'?'rgm':p.role==='ASM'?'asm':'sales',meta=[p.area||p.region,p.partial?'Data sementara':'',p.cutoff?'ST s.d. '+p.cutoff:''].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');return `<details class="mobileKpiPerson level-${level}"><summary><span class="kpiLevel">${esc(p.role)}</span><span class="mobileKpiPersonName">${esc(p.nama)}${p.acting?' · Rangkap':''}</span><b class="mobileKpiPersonScore">${pct(p.kpi.score)}</b><small class="mobileKpiPersonMeta">${esc(meta)}</small></summary><div class="kpiTreeContent">${kpiHtml(p.kpi)}</div></details>`;}).join('');const key='mobileKpi'+role;return `<details class="mobileKpiRole" data-fold="${key}" ${collapsePrefs[key]===true?'open':''}><summary><span class="mobileKpiRoleTitle">Perbandingan KPI ${labels[role]}<small>${num(people.length)} orang · ketuk untuk buka/tutup</small></span><b class="mobileKpiRoleScore">${pct(average)}</b></summary><div class="mobileKpiRoleBody">${cards}</div></details>`;}).join('');
 return `<div class="kpiMobileCompare">${html||'<div class="empty">Belum ada anggota tim yang dapat dibandingkan.</div>'}</div>`;
}
function kpis(v){
